direction: right
Customer: Customer {shape: person}
App: Delivery app {shape: page}
Saga: Delivery saga {shape: hexagon}
Restaurant: Restaurant service {shape: rectangle}
Payment: Payment service {shape: rectangle}
Courier: Courier dispatch {shape: rectangle}
Tracking: Live tracking {shape: stored_data}
Orders: Order database {shape: cylinder}
Notifications: Notification stream {shape: queue}
Customer -> App: place order
App -> Saga
Saga -> Restaurant: accept order
Restaurant -> Saga: accepted
Saga -> Payment: authorize
Payment -> Saga: authorized
Saga -> Courier: find courier
Courier -> Saga: courier assigned
Saga -> Orders: confirm order
Courier -> Tracking: location updates
Saga -> Notifications: status events
Notifications -> App
Restaurant -> Saga: rejected
Saga -> Payment: void authorization
Courier -> Saga: no courier found
Saga -> Restaurant: cancel preparation
Saga -> Orders: cancel order
